{"product_id":"alight","title":"Alight","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"30\" data-end=\"441\"\u003eSo you wake up on an alien planet, buried alive in a coffin, and your first thought is: “This is not how I planned my day.” Welcome to the world of \u003cem data-start=\"178\" data-end=\"186\"\u003eAlight\u003c\/em\u003e, the second book in Scott Sigler’s pulse-pounding Generations Trilogy, where survival isn’t just about food, water, or breathable air—it’s about trust. And in this group of teenagers (because of course it had to be teenagers), trust is in short supply.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"925\"\u003eEm and her fellow survivors thought escaping Earth’s horrors would mean a fresh start. Instead, they find themselves stranded in a place that feels more like a nightmare disguised as paradise. Alien ruins. Mysterious technology. Secrets buried deeper than the planet’s crust. And the worst part? The greatest danger isn’t the planet itself—it’s the people standing right beside her. Because when everyone’s been lied to their whole lives, betrayal comes as naturally as breathing.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1185\"\u003ePart sci-fi survival story, part Lord of the Flies with a side of alien tech, \u003cem data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1013\"\u003eAlight\u003c\/em\u003e is brutal, fast-paced, and utterly addictive. You’ll be tearing through chapters at 2 a.m., promising yourself “just one more,” until you realize you’re hooked for good.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1321\"\u003eProduct details\u003cbr data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1209\"\u003eAuthor: Scott Sigler\u003cbr data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1232\"\u003eFormat: Paperback\u003cbr data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1252\"\u003ePages: 576\u003cbr data-start=\"1262\" data-end=\"1265\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eISBN: 9780553393156\u003cbr data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1287\"\u003eDimensions: 19.8 x 12.9 x 3.4 cm\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":